<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
{{> head title="일정보드"}}
<body>
  {{> header}}
  {{> sidebar page="schedule"}}

  <div class="app-main">
    <div class="app-content">
      <div class="page-header">
        <div>
          <h1>공통 일정보드</h1>
          <p>공휴일과 공통 업무 일정입니다. 누구나 조회할 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">소개</a>
          {{#if user}}
            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-outline-primary">대시보드</a>
          {{/if}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="calendar-surface" aria-label="공통 캘린더">
        <div id="calendarMessage" class="calendar-message" role="alert"></div>
        <div id="workflowCalendar"></div>
      </section>
    </div>
    {{> footer version="0.0.1"}}
  </div>

  {{> scripts}}
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/fullcalendar@6.1.21/index.global.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fullcalendar/core@6.1.21/locales/ko.global.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/calendar/common-calendar.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
